STARTFONT 2.1
COMMENT Glinda 9: the application font of the Glider 4 port, as on the desktop.
COMMENT The glyphs of the Geneva 9 bitmap font, from the System file of Executor
COMMENT (https://github.com/autc04/executor, MIT license), re-encoded.
COMMENT The MAC_ properties keep QuickDraw font metrics; the missing-character glyph is ENCODING -1.
FONT Glinda-9
SIZE 9 72 72
FONTBOUNDINGBOX 9 12 0 -2
STARTPROPERTIES 11
FAMILY_NAME "Glinda"
PIXEL_SIZE 9
POINT_SIZE 90
FONT_ASCENT 10
FONT_DESCENT 2
DEFAULT_CHAR -1
MAC_LEADING 0
MAC_WIDMAX 10
MAC_KERNMAX 0
MAC_NDESCENT -10
MAC_FRECTWIDTH 10
ENDPROPERTIES
